  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As energy of one photon is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>Power</mi><mrow><mi>Photon</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>frequency</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Or,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>&#957;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>16</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>So, frequency of ray is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#957;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>21</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math>.</p><p>Thus, the radiation belongs to gamma rays.</p>",
